    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"healing and rebirth\"... i dont see it that way. it doesn't feel like a transition. it feels like the well ran dry and it's never coming back. i look at my old work and it feels like it was written by a stranger, someone who actually had something to offer the world. now i'm just wasting time, taking up air, waiting for nothing. it's just a long, slow decay.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
